infringement, then the patent license granted to that recipient under this
Section 15 terminates automatically as of the date such litigation is filed.
This Section 15.2 applies only to litigation concerning the Work or products
incorporating the Work, and does not apply to unrelated patent disputes
between the recipient and the Licensor.

15.3 No Broader Grant. No patent license is granted with respect to
modifications made by any party other than the Licensor, or to combinations
